1403 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 347 0 R/E(The visual and verbal elements of Wingstop reflect the \215Jester\216 brand personality through playful and energetic branding. On social media platforms such as TikTok and Instagram, Wingstop uses humour, trending content, and casual captions to appear digitally native and relatable to younger audiences. Instead of focusing only on food promotion, the brand creates entertaining content that fits online youth culture. This helps distinguish Wingstop from other fast food brands, as the brand focuses heavily on humour, interaction, and online engagement.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

1404 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 347 0 R/E(The visual identity also reinforces this personality. Bright green-and-white colours, bold fonts, and attention-grabbing graphics are repeated across stores, packaging, and advertisements. These elements create a fun and memorable brand image. )/Pg 22 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

1405 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 347 0 R/E(During the field visit, the informal dining layout, communal seating, and graphic wall designs created a relaxed and social atmosphere. Overall, the consistent branding creates an enjoyable customer experience where customers can relax, socialise, and enjoy an informal dining experience.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

